I have never tried to raise the enchantment on a ring (although you
never know, maybe wielding it and doing "enchant weapon"...).  Maybe in
future versions rings could be considered armour, and so subject to
enchant/destroy armour scrolls?

Spoiler for rings:




























When you clean out a barracks, take all the rings of protection and
increase strength and drop them on an altar.  Throw away all neutral and
cursed ones.  Try on each blessed one (and the game should identify its
+ rating for you, because you can see the increased strength/AC).  You
should be able to come up with 2 +5 rings of protection if the barracks
was big enough.

You can polymorph the enchanted rings if you're into abuse to get
+dexterity, +charisma, etc.

